cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use ChandraMap in your research or software, please cite it using the metadata in this file."
title: ChandraMap
abstract: >-
  ChandraMap is an open-source research software project for lunar image
  correspondence and registration across multi-sensor imagery, addressing
  differences in resolution, illumination, Sun angle, scale, and modality,
  with an emphasis on geometric verification and reproducible evaluation.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Bhosale
    given-names: Aryan
keywords:
  - lunar image registration
  - image correspondence
  - remote sensing
  - computer vision
  - Chandrayaan-2
  - Lunar Reconnaissance Orbiter
  - multi-sensor image registration
  - geospatial localization
  - planetary science
